SUMMARY:Grease the Musical
DESCRIPTION:Leather jackets and poodle skirts are taking over the Woodland Opera House stage this August as The Woodland Wellness Collective presents Grease. Set in 1959 at Rydell High\, Grease follows the duck-tailed\, hot-rodding Burger Palace Boys and the gum-snapping Pink Ladies as they navigate friendship\, first love\, peer pressure\, and growing up. After a whirlwind summer romance\, Danny Zuko and Sandy Dumbrowski unexpectedly reunite at school\, where Danny must choose between his tough-guy image and his true feelings. Packed with unforgettable characters\, energetic dance numbers\, and a rock ‘n’ roll score that has captivated audiences for decades\, Grease remains a timeless celebration of youth and self-discovery. \nShow Run: August 7-22\, 2026 \nWeek 1: Friday and Saturday at 7:30 p.m.\, Sunday at 2:00 p.m.\nWeek 2: Thursday and Friday at 7:30 p.m.\, Saturday at 2:00 and 7:30 p.m.\, Sunday at 2:00 p.m.\nWeek 3: Thursday and Friday at 7:30 p.m.\, Saturday at 2:00 and 7:30 p.m. \nRun Time: Approximately 2 hours and 30 minutes\, including a 15 minute intermission \n“Grease” is presented by special arrangement with Samuel French\, Inc.\, a Concord Theatricals Company. www.concordtheatricals.com​
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/grease-the-musical/2026-08-22/1/
LOCATION:Woodland Opera House\, 340 2nd Street\, Woodland\, California
CATEGORIES:Community,Stage & Dance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Grease-Square-for-website-2-2.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Woodland Opera House":MAILTO:boxoffice@woodlandoperahouse.org
GEO:40.5161884;-79.8458488
