 on. Disappeared in America is a Yolo County day of action to stand up for 
 the rule of law and confront the Trump administration’s illegal abductio
 ns\, detentions\, and deportations of people like Kilmar Abrego Garcia\, R
 ui Marras\, and Juan Maldonado Zuniga. 🚨 On the 1st Wednesday of the mo
 nth\, we’re showing up in Davis near City Hall at the intersection of 5t
 h & B St. B
LOCATION:Near City Hall at the intersection of Fifth & B Sts\, Fifth St. a
 nd B St.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisibleyolo/event/816339/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Yolo (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
